        "language": "english",
        "review": "To be blunt, as this game is right now, it's not worth it.\n\nPros:\nCute character creator (picrew-style)\nLots of customisation options\n\nCons:\nBuggy mess\nAI\nHorrible POC options in the character creator\nStory is stale \n\nI couldn't find it anywhere on the steam page, but after googling I found out the English translation is mostly AI, which I would be kind of okay overlooking. If the story was actually any good. Plus the fanfic writing aspect is powered by a delusional AI that will ramble, and ramble with no rhyme or reason. Which can lead to basically getting stuck in a loop. I really tried to like this game, it's right up my alley, but it's just not enjoyable. \n\nAll of the characters personalities can be summed up to \"Omg you're soo cool, and we love your fanfics, marry us pls.\" Which I guess, reflects the games title, but it doesn't make for a very interesting exprience. The game also either overexplains, or doesn't really explain at all. \n\nThe entire 2 hours I played of this game can be summed up in one word: frustrating. \n\nI feel like with the fanfic writing there are so many ways to implement it, without the use of AI. It almost feels like a slap in the face to irl writers. \n\nThis game needs a lot of work before it's worth buying imo.",
