        "review": "It's sort of a dream game for me where the plot and gameplay centers around a cute dollmaker you can use to recreate ships from your fandoms.\n\nBut the English translation is dreadful, and when half your game is about writing fanfiction, it sucks that the English translation didn't get the care it deserved. This would easily be a top game for me if the translation wasn't so rough. I'll change my review if they ever retranslate the game.",
